        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>100+页MAPK信号通路详解</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 24px 20px;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", sans-serif;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    max-width: 560px;\n  }\n  h1.page-title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 26px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin: 4px 0 22px 0;\n  }\n  p.lead {\n    font-size: 19px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    text-align: justify;\n    margin: 0 0 26px 0;\n  }\n  .slide {\n    border: 1px solid #d9d9d9;\n    background: #fff;\n    padding: 14px 16px 10px 16px;\n    margin: 0 8px 30px 8px;\n    position: relative;\n    box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\n  }\n  .slide-head {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .slide-title {\n    font-size: 17px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #123a6b;\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #123a6b;\n    padding-bottom: 3px;\n    display: inline-block;\n  }\n  .watermark {\n    font-size: 9px;\n    color: #c98a95;\n    border: 1px solid #eccfd4;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    padding: 2px 8px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    background: #fafafa;\n    border: 1px dashed #bbb;\n    color: #777;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .chart-row {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 6px;\n    align-items: stretch;\n  }\n  .chart-row .placeholder { flex: 1; height: 120px; }\n  .caption {\n    font-size: 9px;\n    font-style: italic;\n    color: #333;\n    margin-top: 8px;\n  }\n  .two-col {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 14px;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n  }\n  .two-col .left { flex: 0 0 55%; }\n  .two-col .right { flex: 1; padding-top: 14px; }\n  ul.bullets {\n    list-style: none;\n    padding: 0;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  ul.bullets li {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    margin: 0 0 18px 0;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n  ul.bullets li::before {\n    content: \"◆ \";\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  ul.plain {\n    list-style: none;\n    padding: 0;\n    margin: 4px 0 0 0;\n  }\n  ul.plain li {\n    font-size: 10px;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  ul.plain li::before {\n    content: \"● \";\n    color: #444;\n  }\n  .ref {\n    font-size: 8.5px;\n    color: #222;\n    text-align: right;\n    margin-top: 8px;\n  }\n  .speaker {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 12px;\n    bottom: 10px;\n    width: 20px;\n    height: 18px;\n    border: none;\n    color: #9a9a9a;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .bottom-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 10px;\n  }\n  .underline { text-decoration: underline; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<h1 class=\"page-title\">100+页MAPK信号通路详解</h1>\n\n<p class=\"lead\">丝裂原活化蛋白激酶(mitogen-activated protein kinase，MAPK)，一种丝氨酸-苏氨酸蛋白激酶。丝裂原，顾名思义，最早发现该激酶参与细胞有丝分裂。所有的真核细胞都能表达MAPK，从酵母到人类都高度保守。</p>\n\n<!-- Slide 1 -->\n<section class=\"slide\">\n  <div class=\"slide-head\">\n    <span class=\"slide-title\">细胞凋亡与MAPK</span>\n    <span class=\"watermark\">[Logo: 圆形图标] 仙鹤学术</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"chart-row\">\n    <div class=\"placeholder\">[Chart: bar graph, y-axis \"Apoptotic cells (%)\" 0–20; x-axis labels \"Control\", \"Anti-NGF\", \"Anti-NGF + PD98[?]\", \"Anti-NGF + sNGF\", \"Anti-NGF + Insulin\"]</div>\n    <div class=\"placeholder\">[Chart: bar graph, y-axis \"Relative JNK activity\"; x-axis labels \"Control\", \"Anti-NGF\", \"Anti-NGF + PD98[?]\", \"Anti-NGF + sNGF\", \"Anti-NGF + Insulin\"]</div>\n    <div class=\"placeholder\">[Chart: bar graph, y-axis \"Relative p38 kinase activity\"; x-axis labels \"Control\", \"Anti-NGF\", \"Anti-NGF + PD98[?]\", \"Anti-NGF + sNGF\", \"Anti-NGF + Insulin\"]</div>\n    <div class=\"placeholder\">[Chart: panel \"E\", bar graph, y-axis \"ERK activity (pmol/min/assay)\" 0.00–0.30; x-axis labels \"Control\", \"Anti-NGF\"]</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"bottom-row\">\n    <div class=\"caption\">Zhengui Xia et al., Science, 1995</div>\n    <div style=\"flex:1;\">\n      <ul class=\"plain\">\n        <li>一般认为，ERK抑制细胞凋亡</li>\n        <li>p38与JNK促进凋亡</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"speaker\">[Icon: speaker]</div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- Slide 2 -->\n<section class=\"slide\">\n  <div class=\"slide-head\">\n    <span class=\"slide-title\">MAPK信号通路</span>\n    <span class=\"watermark\">[Logo: 圆形图标] 仙鹤学术</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"two-col\">\n    <div class=\"left\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"height: 175px;\">[Diagram: MAPK信号通路示意图，含细胞膜受体、RAS/RAF/MEK/ERK、JNK、p38级联，核内转录因子及下游 Angiogenesis / Proliferation / Apoptosis / Differentiation / Metastasis]</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"right\">\n      <ul class=\"bullets\">\n        <li>多级调控，级联放大</li>\n        <li>基于<span class=\"underline\">磷酸化</span>的信号传导形式</li>\n        <li>相对简单、直线、单一的传导方式</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"ref\">Jing Yuan Fang and Bruce C Richardson, <em>Lancet Oncol</em>, 2005</div>\n\n  <div class=\"speaker\">[Icon: speaker]</div>\n</section>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
